{"step_index":418,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-06T06:06:46Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-06T15:06:46+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-06T15:06:46+09:00\nShowing lines 1-91 of 91\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\n2: \"\"\"\n3: create_2periods_vac5A_model.py\n4: 2H-SiC {10-10} 2周期 (4層, 72原子) 真空層 5.0 Å 自然へき開スラブ & バルクモデル生成・検証スクリプト\n5: 【準拠ルール】\n6: - AGENTS.md §10: ASE surface(bulk, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=2*N) による統一生成\n7: - 両端が密結合保持 (dz ≈ 0.888 Å)、外側切断面が粗結合 (dz ≈ 1.776 Å) であることを自動検証\n8: \"\"\"\n9: import os\n10: import json\n11: import numpy as np\n12: import ase.io\n13: from ase.build import surface\n14: from ase.io.lammpsdata import write_lammps_data\n15: \n16: \n17: def build_2periods_vac5a_model():\n18:     out_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n19:     workspace_dir = os.path.dirname(out_dir)\n20:     cif_input = os.path.join(workspace_dir, \"research_simulations\", \"2H-SiC.cif\")\n21: \n22:     print(f\"Loading 2H-SiC crystal from {cif_input}...\")\n23:     bulk_cif = ase.io.read(cif_input)\n24: \n25:     # 1. {10-10} 面スラブの構築 (N=2周期 -> layers=2: 1周期2層なので合計4層)\n26:     slab_unit = surface(bulk_cif, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=2, vacuum=None)\n27: \n28:     # 2. 3x3x1 スーパーセル (面内 3x3, 72原子)\n29:     slab_3x3 = slab_unit * (3, 3, 1)\n30: \n31:     # 3. z方向の座標調整と真空層の追加 (上下に各 5.0 Å, 合計 10.0 Å)\n32:     pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n33:     z_min = float(np.min(pos[:, 2]))\n34:     z_max = float(np.max(pos[:, 2]))\n35:     thickness = z_max - z_min\n36: \n37:     pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + 5.0\n38:     slab_3x3.positions = pos\n39: \n40:     cell = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n41:     cell[2, 2] = thickness + 10.0\n42:     slab_3x3.cell = cell\n43:     slab_3x3.pbc = [True, True, True]\n44:     slab_3x3.wrap()\n45: \n46:     # 4. 層間距離と非極性 (Tasker Type I) の自動検証\n47:     z_unique = np.unique(np.round(slab_3x3.positions[:, 2], 4))\n48:     diffs = [round(float(z_unique[i + 1] - z_unique[i]), 4) for i in range(len(z_unique) - 1)]\n49:     n_si = sum(s == 'Si' for s in slab_3x3.get_chemical_symbols())\n50:     n_c = sum(s == 'C' for s in slab_3x3.get_chemical_symbols())\n51: \n52:     print(\"\\n==========================================\")\n53:     print(\"2-Periods (72 atoms) Vacuum 5.0 Å Natural Cleavage Slab Verified:\")\n54:     print(f\"  - Total Atoms: {len(slab_3x3)} (Si: {n_si}, C: {n_c})\")\n55:     print(f\"  - Cell: Lx={slab_3x3.cell[0,0]:.4f} Å, Ly={slab_3x3.cell[1,1]:.4f} Å, Lz={slab_3x3.cell[2,2]:.4f} Å\")\n56:     print(f\"  - Slab Thickness: {thickness:.4f} Å\")\n57:     print(f\"  - Atomic Layers ({len(z_unique)} layers): {z_unique} Å\")\n58:     print(f\"  - Interlayer Spacings: {diffs} Å (Expected: [0.8881, 1.7758, 0.8881])\")\n59:     print(f\"  - Bottom Vacuum: {np.min(slab_3x3.positions[:, 2]):.4f} Å (Target: 5.0 Å)\")\n60:     print(f\"  - Top Vacuum:    {slab_3x3.cell[2,2] - np.max(slab_3x3.positions[:, 2]):.4f} Å (Target: 5.0 Å)\")\n61:     print(\"==========================================\\n\")\n62: \n63:     # 5. スラブモデル保存\n64:     prefix_slab = os.path.join(out_dir, \"2H-SiC_10-10_slab_3x3x2_vac5A\")\n65:     ase.io.write(f\"{prefix_slab}.cif\", slab_3x3)\n66:     ase.io.write(f\"{prefix_slab}.xyz\", slab_3x3)\n67:     write_lammps_data(f\"{prefix_slab}.data\", slab_3x3, atom_style='atomic', masses=True)\n68: \n69:     # 6. バルク基準モデル保存 (真空 0 Å, 72原子)\n70:     bulk_pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n71:     bulk_pos[:, 2] = bulk_pos[:, 2] - 5.0\n72:     bulk_cell = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n73:     bulk_cell[2, 2] = thickness + diffs[1]\n74:     bulk_atoms = ase.Atoms(\n75:         symbols=slab_3x3.get_chemical_symbols(),\n76:         positions=bulk_pos,\n77:         cell=bulk_cell,\n78:         pbc=[True, True, True],\n79:     )\n80:     bulk_atoms.wrap()\n81: \n82:     prefix_bulk = os.path.join(out_dir, \"2H-SiC_10-10_bulk_3x3x2_72atoms\")\n83:     ase.io.write(f\"{prefix_bulk}.cif\", bulk_atoms)\n84:     ase.io.write(f\"{prefix_bulk}.xyz\", bulk_atoms)\n85:     write_lammps_data(f\"{prefix_bulk}.data\", bulk_atoms, atom_style='atomic', masses=True)\n86:     print(f\"✅ Successfully verified and wrote structure files in {out_dir}\")\n87: \n88: \n89: if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n90:     build_2periods_vac5a_model()\n91: "}
{"step_index":419,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-06T06:06:46Z","input_tokens":6309,"cache_read_tokens":216156,"output_tokens":8868,"thinking":"The vacuum parameter appears to directly define the bottom vacuum value in Angstroms, with the parameter's value equal to the bottom vacuum distance. This suggests a straightforward relationship between the specified vacuum parameter and the bottom vacuum. It's likely that other vacuum-related parameters are also derived from this initial value.\n\n\nThe bottom vacuum distance ($V$) directly influences the z-coordinate calculations. The formula `pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + V` confirms this, where `z_min` is adjusted by the vacuum value. The lattice parameter $L_z$ (cell[2,2]) is computed using twice the vacuum value and the thickness. Calculations with different vacuum values (2.5, 5.0, 10.0 Angstroms) demonstrate the effects on z-coordinate extremes and lattice parameter $L_z$.\n\nIt's necessary to verify the NAS folder naming convention for data storage based on the user's requirement. Need to confirm the directory structure on the NAS, particularly the format \"{101_0}2-cycle[Vacuum_Value_Angstroms]\".\n\n\nThe naming convention uses integers without a decimal for whole numbers and includes a decimal for values with a fractional component, based on the provided examples. The evidence supports the format `{101_0}2周期1Å` for integers, and `{101_0}2周期5.0Å` for values with decimal points. This is consistent with earlier naming rules in the provided context.\n\n\nThe user's request is to automate a calculation workflow with varying vacuum layer thicknesses. A script `/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py` has been created to achieve this. The script iterates through vacuum thicknesses from 0.5 to 10.0 Angstroms.\n\nFor each thickness value, the script sets the vacuum parameter, generates the corresponding input data, executes the calculations, and stores the results according to the identified naming conventions. The user can execute this script directly.\n\n\nThe workflow involves generating and relaxing a 72-atom 2H-SiC slab model with varying vacuum thicknesses, using a consistent DFT and LAMMPS setup. Independent directories are created for each vacuum thickness to prevent overwriting. Each simulation sets up the 2H-SiC slab model with the correct vacuum value, then performs the MDI relaxation and produces data for analysis. The resulting LAMMPS trajectory file is converted to a Winmostar-compatible format for visualization and further analysis.\n\n\nThe script calculates the surface energy and automatically stores results. It computes the energy difference between the slab and bulk, then the surface energy. This data is appended to two files and used to update a surface energy graph. After each calculation, the script automatically creates a corresponding directory on the network drive and copies the data into it. The script can resume from interrupted points, skipping already-completed simulations. The workflow can be initiated with the `/goal` command.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\nr\"\"\"\nrun_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py\n==============================================================================\n2H-SiC {10-10} 2周期 (4層, 72原子) スラブモデルにおける\n真空層厚さ 0.5 Å 〜 10.0 Å (0.5 Å刻み・全20条件) 自動パラメトリックスイープ実行スクリプト\n==============================================================================\n【機能概要】\n1. 対象真空層リスト (全20条件):\n   [0.5, 1, 1.5, 2, 2.5, 3.0, 3.5, 4.0, 4.5, 5.0, 5.5, 6.0, 6.5, 7.0, 7.5, 8, 8.5, 9.0, 9.5, 10]\n2. 各条件ごとに独立したローカルディレクトリを作成 (既存ファイル非上書き原則):\n   calc_2H-SiC_10-10_2periods_vac<V>A_rtx5080/\n3. ASE surface(bulk, indices=(1,0,0), layers=2) により自然へき開面 (粗結合 1.7758 Å 切断)\n   72原子スラブモデルを自動生成し、層間距離プロファイル [0.8881, 1.7758, 0.8881] を検証。\n4. 最近と完全同一の解析条件で LAMMPS + Quantum ESPRESSO MDI 連成構造緩和を実行:\n   - DFT: ecutwfc = 40.0 Ry, ecutrho = 320.0 Ry, conv_thr = 1.0e-5 Ry, Γ点, local-TF (0.3)\n   - CG緩和: minimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-2 100 150\n   - 並列: MPI_NP=12 x OMP_NUM_THREADS=2 (Core Ultra 9 285K 24スレッド)\n5. 各条件完了ごとに直ちに以下を自動実行:\n   - md_animation.xyz 生成 (Atom ID 昇順ソート, Type 1=C, Type 2=Si)\n   - 3種推移グラフ自動生成 (Total_Energy / Total_Force / Total_SCF_Correction)\n   - 表面破壊エネルギー γ 算出 (基準バルク E_bulk(72) = -31935.3572 eV)\n   - SURFACE_ENERGY_RESULTS.md および surface_energy_results.csv への自動追記\n   - NAS (\\\\192.168.12.69\\Results\\yamazaki\\research\\{101_0}2周期〇Å) への自動フォルダ作成・全データ保存\n6. 全条件完了後 (および各ステップ完了時) に真空層厚さ依存性グラフを更新出力。\n\"\"\"\nimport os\nimport sys\nimport re\nimport csv\nimport json\nimport time\nimport base64\nimport shutil\nimport datetime\nimport subprocess\nimport numpy as np\nimport ase.io\nfrom ase.build import surface\nfrom ase.io.lammpsdata import write_lammps_data\n\nWORKSPACE_DIR = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup\"\nENV_PREFIX = \"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_env_rtx5080\"\nTEMPLATE_DIR = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"calc_2H-SiC_10-10_8periods_vac5A_natural_cleavage\")\nBULK_2P_DIR = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"calc_2H-SiC_10-10_2periods_vac5A_local_RTX5080\")\nCIF_INPUT = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"research_simulations\", \"2H-SiC.cif\")\n\n# 2周期 (72原子) 真のバルク 1点 SCF エネルギー確定値\nE_BULK_72_EV = -31935.3572\nE_BULK_72_RY = -2347.20460730\nAREA_A = 139.748832\nAREA_2A = 279.497664\nCONV_FACTOR = 16.021766\nEFFECTIVE_DENOM = AREA_2A / CONV_FACTOR\n\n# 0.5 Å 〜 10.0 Å (0.5 Å刻み・全20条件) とユーザー指定フォルダ名表記の対応\nVACUUM_SWEEP_LIST = [\n    (0.5, \"0.5\", \"{101_0}2周期0.5Å\"),\n    (1.0, \"1.0\", \"{101_0}2周期1Å\"),\n    (1.5, \"1.5\", \"{101_0}2周期1.5Å\"),\n    (2.0, \"2.0\", \"{101_0}2周期2Å\"),\n    (2.5, \"2.5\", \"{101_0}2周期2.5Å\"),\n    (3.0, \"3.0\", \"{101_0}2周期3.0Å\"),\n    (3.5, \"3.5\", \"{101_0}2周期3.5Å\"),\n    (4.0, \"4.0\", \"{101_0}2周期4.0Å\"),\n    (4.5, \"4.5\", \"{101_0}2周期4.5Å\"),\n    (5.0, \"5.0\", \"{101_0}2周期5.0Å\"),\n    (5.5, \"5.5\", \"{101_0}2周期5.5Å\"),\n    (6.0, \"6.0\", \"{101_0}2周期6.0Å\"),\n    (6.5, \"6.5\", \"{101_0}2周期6.5Å\"),\n    (7.0, \"7.0\", \"{101_0}2周期7.0Å\"),\n    (7.5, \"7.5\", \"{101_0}2周期7.5Å\"),\n    (8.0, \"8.0\", \"{101_0}2周期8Å\"),\n    (8.5, \"8.5\", \"{101_0}2周期8.5Å\"),\n    (9.0, \"9.0\", \"{101_0}2周期9.0Å\"),\n    (9.5, \"9.5\", \"{101_0}2周期9.5Å\"),\n    (10.0, \"10.0\", \"{101_0}2周期10Å\"),\n]\n\n\ndef log(msg):\n    now = datetime.datetime.now().strftime(\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\")\n    print(f\"[{now}] {msg}\", flush=True)\n\n\ndef prepare_condition_directory(vac_val, vac_str, nas_folder_name, port):\n    \"\"\"各真空層厚さ V [Å] の専用ディレクトリと入力ファイル一式を生成\"\"\"\n    calc_dir_name = f\"calc_2H-SiC_10-10_2periods_vac{vac_str}A_rtx5080\"\n    calc_dir = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, calc_dir_name)\n    os.makedirs(calc_dir, exist_ok=True)\n\n    # 1. 共通アセットのコピー\n    for asset in [\n        \"C.upf\",\n        \"Si.upf\",\n        \"RELAXATION_GRAPH_PROTOCOL.json\",\n        \"dft_settings.py\",\n        \"make_xyz.py\",\n        \"msmincho.ttc\",\n        \"times.ttf\",\n        \"auto_generate_progression_graphs.py\",\n        \"qe_mdi_engine_rtx5080.py\",\n    ]:\n        src_asset = os.path.join(TEMPLATE_DIR, asset)\n        dst_asset = os.path.join(calc_dir, asset)\n        if not os.path.exists(dst_asset):\n            shutil.copyfile(src_asset, dst_asset)\n\n    # 2周期バルクSCFログも参考用に同梱\n    for bulk_file in [\"2H-SiC_10-10_bulk_3x3x2_72atoms.data\", \"espresso_bulk_scf.pwi\", \"espresso_bulk_scf.pwo\"]:\n        src_bf = os.path.join(BULK_2P_DIR, bulk_file)\n        if os.path.exists(src_bf):\n            shutil.copyfile(src_bf, os.path.join(calc_dir, bulk_file))\n\n    # 2. ASE surface() による 2周期 (4層, 72原子) 自然へき開面スラブモデルの構築\n    bulk_cif = ase.io.read(CIF_INPUT)\n    slab_unit = surface(bulk_cif, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=2, vacuum=None)\n    slab_3x3 = slab_unit * (3, 3, 1)\n\n    pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n    z_min = float(np.min(pos[:, 2]))\n    z_max = float(np.max(pos[:, 2]))\n    thickness = z_max - z_min\n\n    # 下部真空層 = vac_val [Å], 上部真空層 = vac_val [Å] (合計 2 * vac_val [Å])\n    pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + vac_val\n    slab_3x3.positions = pos\n\n    cell = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n    cell[2, 2] = thickness + 2.0 * vac_val\n    slab_3x3.cell = cell\n    slab_3x3.pbc = [True, True, True]\n\n    # 層間間隔プロファイルの厳格検証 ([0.8881, 1.7758, 0.8881])\n    z_unique = np.unique(np.round(slab_3x3.positions[:, 2], 4))\n    diffs = [round(float(z_unique[i + 1] - z_unique[i]), 4) for i in range(len(z_unique) - 1)]\n    if len(diffs) != 3 or abs(diffs[0] - 0.8881) > 0.005 or abs(diffs[1] - 1.7758) > 0.005:\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"Invalid interlayer spacing profile for vac={vac_val}A: {diffs}\")\n\n    slab_prefix = f\"2H-SiC_10-10_slab_3x3x2_vac{vac_str}A\"\n    ase.io.write(os.path.join(calc_dir, f\"{slab_prefix}.cif\"), slab_3x3)\n    ase.io.write(os.path.join(calc_dir, f\"{slab_prefix}.xyz\"), slab_3x3)\n    write_lammps_data(os.path.join(calc_dir, f\"{slab_prefix}.data\"), slab_3x3, atom_style=\"atomic\", masses=True)\n\n    # 3. in.lammps & in.lammps.optimized_conv の作成 (AGENTS.md §9 恒久標準)\n    in_lammps_content = f\"\"\"# 2H-SiC {{10-10}} 2周期 (4層, 72原子) 真空層 {vac_str} Å スラブ構造緩和入力スクリプト\n# 【最適化収束条件標準: minimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-2 100 150 (AGENTS.md §9)】\nunits metal\nboundary p p p\natom_style atomic\natom_modify map yes\n\nread_data {slab_prefix}.data\n\n# Type 1: C (12.011), Type 2: Si (28.085) (AGENTS.md §2)\nmass 1 12.011\nmass 2 28.085\n\nfix 1 all mdi/qm elements C Si\n\nthermo 1\nthermo_modify flush yes\ndump 1 all custom 1 dump.lammpstrj id type x y z\ndump_modify 1 append yes flush yes\n\nminimize 1.0e-6 1.0e-2 100 150\n\nundump 1\nwrite_data {slab_prefix}_relaxed.data\n\"\"\"\n    for fname in [\"in.lammps\", \"in.lammps.optimized_conv\"]:\n        with open(os.path.join(calc_dir, fname), \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            f.write(in_lammps_content)\n\n    # 4. fracture_metadata.json の作成\n    meta = {\n        \"cleavage_plane\": \"10-10\",\n        \"cleavage_type\": \"natural_cleavage_sparse_bond\",\n        \"n_periods\": 2,\n        \"n_layers\": 4,\n        \"natoms\": 72,\n        \"vacuum_thickness_angstrom\": vac_val,\n        \"supercell_xy\": [3, 3],\n        \"cell_slab\": [float(slab_3x3.cell[0, 0]), float(slab_3x3.cell[1, 1]), float(slab_3x3.cell[2, 2])],\n        \"cell_bulk\": [9.228, 15.144, 5.327788],\n        \"area_A_angstrom2\": AREA_A,\n        \"total_area_2A_angstrom2\": AREA_2A,\n        \"unit_conversion_eV_A2_to_J_m2\": CONV_FACTOR,\n        \"effective_denominator\": EFFECTIVE_DENOM,\n        \"true_bulk_scf_energy_Ry\": E_BULK_72_RY,\n        \"true_bulk_scf_energy_eV\": E_BULK_72_EV,\n        \"reference_rauls_relaxed_J_m2\": 2.27,\n        \"reference_rauls_unrelaxed_J_m2\": 2.44,\n        \"reference_rauls_dimer_J_m2\": 3.03,\n        \"slab_data_file\": f\"{slab_prefix}.data\",\n        \"bulk_data_file\": \"2H-SiC_10-10_bulk_3x3x2_72atoms.data\",\n        \"nas_folder_name\": nas_folder_name,\n    }\n    meta_path = os.path.join(calc_dir, \"fracture_metadata.json\")\n    if not os.path.exists(meta_path):\n        with open(meta_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n            json.dump(meta, f, indent=4, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    return calc_dir, slab_prefix\n\n\ndef is_condition_already_converged(calc_dir):\n    \"\"\"既に計算が完了し、緩和後エネルギーとグラフが揃っているか判定\"\"\"\n    meta_path = os.path.join(calc_dir, \"fracture_metadata.json\")\n    log_path = os.path.join(calc_dir, \"log.lammps\")\n    graph_path = os.path.join(calc_dir, \"Total_Energy_progression.png\")\n    if os.path.exists(meta_path) and os.path.exists(log_path) and os.path.exists(graph_path):\n        try:\n            with open(meta_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n                meta = json.load(f)\n            if \"surface_fracture_energy_J_m2\" in meta and \"relaxed_slab_energy_eV\" in meta:\n                with open(log_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\") as lf:\n                    if \"Minimization stats:\" in lf.read():\n                        return True\n        except Exception:\n            pass\n    return False\n\n\ndef run_single_condition(vac_val, vac_str, nas_folder_name, port):\n    \"\"\"1つの真空層条件について構造緩和・XYZ変換・3種グラフ生成・γ算出を実行\"\"\"\n    calc_dir, slab_prefix = prepare_condition_directory(vac_val, vac_str, nas_folder_name, port)\n\n    if is_condition_already_converged(calc_dir):\n        log(f\"[Skip] vac={vac_str} Å ({calc_dir}) is already converged.\")\n        sync_directory_to_nas(calc_dir, nas_folder_name)\n        return calc_dir\n\n    log(f\"=== Starting 2-Period Slab Relaxation: Vacuum = {vac_str} Å (NAS: {nas_folder_name}) ===\")\n\n    # クリーンアップ (当該新規ディレクトリ内の未完了ログのみ)\n    for fn in [\"tmp\", \"espresso.pwo\", \"espresso_all_steps.pwo\", \"dump.lammpstrj\", \"qe_engine.log\", \"lmp.log\", \"log.lammps\"]:\n        p = os.path.join(calc_dir, fn)\n        if os.path.isdir(p):\n            shutil.rmtree(p, ignore_errors=True)\n        elif os.path.exists(p):\n            os.remove(p)\n\n    env = os.environ.copy()\n    env[\"PATH\"] = f\"{ENV_PREFIX}/bin:\" + env.get(\"PATH\", \"\")\n    env[\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH\"] = f\"{ENV_PREFIX}/lib:\" + env.get(\"LD_LIBRARY_PATH\", \"\")\n    env[\"OMPI_MCA_btl_vader_single_copy_mechanism\"] = \"none\"\n    env[\"QE_MPI_NP\"] = \"12\"\n    env[\"QE_OMP_THREADS\"] = \"2\"\n\n    lmp_bin = os.path.join(ENV_PREFIX, \"bin\", \"lmp\")\n    py_bin = os.path.join(ENV_PREFIX, \"bin\", \"python3\")\n\n    t0 = time.time()\n    with open(os.path.join(calc_dir, \"lmp.log\"), \"w\") as lmp_out, open(\n        os.path.join(calc_dir, \"qe_engine.log\"), \"w\"\n    ) as qe_out:\n        lmp_proc = subprocess.Popen(\n            [lmp_bin, \"-mdi\", f\"-role DRIVER -name LAMMPS -method TCP -port {port}\", \"-in\", \"in.lammps\"],\n            cwd=calc_dir,\n            env=env,\n            stdout=lmp_out,\n            stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,\n        )\n        time.sleep(1.0)\n        qe_proc = subprocess.Popen(\n            [\n                py_bin,\n                \"qe_mdi_engine_rtx5080.py\",\n                \"-mdi\",\n                f\"-role ENGINE -name QE -method TCP -port {port} -hostname localhost\",\n            ],\n            cwd=calc_dir,\n            env=env,\n            stdout=qe_out,\n            stderr=subprocess.STDOUT,\n        )\n        qe_rc = qe_proc.wait()\n        lmp_rc = lmp_proc.wait()\n\n    elapsed = time.time() - t0\n    if qe_rc != 0 or lmp_rc != 0:\n        raise RuntimeError(f\"MDI calculation failed for vac={vac_str}A (qe_rc={qe_rc}, lmp_rc={lmp_rc})\")\n\n    # Winmostar XYZ アニメーション生成\n    subprocess.run([py_bin, \"make_xyz.py\", \"dump.lammpstrj\", \"md_animation.xyz\"], cwd=calc_dir, env=env, check=True)\n\n    # 3種推移グラフ自動生成 (RELAXATION_GRAPH_PROTOCOL.json 準拠)\n    subprocess.run([py_bin, \"auto_generate_progression_graphs.py\"], cwd=calc_dir, env=env, check=True)\n\n    # エネルギーと表面破壊エネルギー γ の抽出・保存\n    meta_path = os.path.join(calc_dir, \"fracture_metadata.json\")\n    with open(meta_path, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        meta = json.load(f)\n\n    energies_qe = []\n    with open(os.path.join(calc_dir, \"qe_engine.log\"), \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\") as f:\n        for line in f:\n            m = re.search(r\"Total Energy:\\s+([-\\d\\.]+)\\s+eV\", line)\n            if m:\n                energies_qe.append(float(m.group(1)))\n\n    energies_lmp = []\n    with open(os.path.join(calc_dir, \"log.lammps\"), \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"ignore\") as f:\n        text = f.read()\n    m_fin = re.search(r\"Energy initial, next-to-last, final =\\s*\\n\\s*([-\\d\\.]+)\\s+([-\\d\\.]+)\\s+([-\\d\\.]+)\", text)\n    if m_fin:\n        energies_lmp.append(float(m_fin.group(3)))\n\n    e_slab = energies_lmp[-1] if energies_lmp else energies_qe[-1]\n    delta_e = e_slab - E_BULK_72_EV\n    gamma = delta_e / EFFECTIVE_DENOM\n    diff_pct = ((gamma - 2.27) / 2.27) * 100.0\n\n    meta[\"relaxed_slab_energy_eV\"] = round(e_slab, 4)\n    meta[\"delta_energy_eV\"] = round(delta_e, 4)\n    meta[\"surface_fracture_energy_J_m2\"] = round(gamma, 4)\n    meta[\"diff_percent\"] = round(diff_pct, 1)\n    meta[\"elapsed_seconds\"] = round(elapsed, 1)\n\n    with open(meta_path, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n        json.dump(meta, f, indent=4, ensure_ascii=False)\n\n    log(\n        f\"✅ Completed vac={vac_str} Å in {elapsed/60.0:.1f} min | \"\n        f\"E_slab={e_slab:.4f} eV | ΔE={delta_e:.4f} eV | γ={gamma:.4f} J/m²\"\n    )\n\n    # ローカルアーカイブ退避\n    archive_root = os.path.join(WORKSPACE_DIR, \"各条件の計算ディレクトリ\")\n    os.makedirs(archive_root, exist_ok=True)\n    shutil.copytree(calc_dir, os.path.join(archive_root, os.path.basename(calc_dir)), dirs_exist_ok=True)\n\n    # NAS へ自動保存\n    sync_directory_to_nas(calc_dir, nas_folder_name)\n    return calc_dir\n\n\ndef sync_directory_to_nas(calc_dir, nas_folder_name):\n    \"\"\"計算ディレクトリ一式を \\\\\\\\192.168.12.69\\\\Results\\\\yamazaki\\\\research\\\\{101_0}2周期〇Å へ保存\"\"\"\n    ps_bin = \"/mnt/c/Windows/System32/WindowsPowerShell/v1.0/powershell.exe\"\n    if not os.path.exists(ps_bin):\n        log(f\"[Warn] PowerShell not accessible in current mode; skipping NAS upload for {nas_folder_name}.\")\n        return False\n\n    stage_root = \"/mnt/c/temp_sic_sync\"\n    stage_dir = os.path.join(stage_root, \"stage_2p_vac\")\n    os.makedirs(stage_root, exist_ok=True)\n    if os.path.exists(stage_dir):\n        shutil.rmtree(stage_dir)\n    shutil.copytree(calc_dir, stage_dir)\n\n    ps_script = f\"\"\"\n[Console]::OutputEncoding = [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8\n$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'\n$src = 'C:\\\\temp_sic_sync\\\\stage_2p_vac'\n$dstParent = '\\\\\\\\192.168.12.69\\\\Results\\\\yamazaki\\\\research'\n$dst = Join-Path $dstParent '{nas_folder_name}'\nif (!(Test-Path -LiteralPath $dst)) {{\n    New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path $dst -Force | Out-Null\n}}\nGet-ChildItem -LiteralPath $src | ForEach-Object {{\n    Copy-Item -LiteralPath $_.FullName -Destination $dst -Recurse -Force\n}}\n$files = Get-ChildItem -LiteralPath $dst -File\nWrite-Output (\"NAS_SAVED=\" + $dst + \" (Files=\" + $files.Count + \")\")\n\"\"\"\n    encoded_cmd = base64.b64encode(ps_script.encode(\"utf-16-le\")).decode(\"ascii\")\n    res = subprocess.run(\n        [ps_bin, \"-NoProfile\", \"-NonInteractive\", \"-EncodedCommand\", encoded_cmd],\n        text=True,\n        capture_output=True,\n        encoding=\"utf-8\",\n        errors=\"replace\",\n    )\n    if res.returncode == 0 and \"NAS_SAVED=\" in res.stdout:\n        log(f\"  -> {res.stdout.strip()}\")\n        return True\n    else:\n        log(f\"  -> [NAS Warning] {res.stderr.strip()}\")\n        return False\n\n\ndef main():\n    # 引数で特定の真空層のみ実行することも可能 (例: python3 run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py 0.5 1.0)\n    filter_vacs = [float(x) for x in sys.argv[1:]] if len(sys.argv) > 1 else None\n\n    base_port = 8030\n    for idx, (vac_val, vac_str, nas_folder_name) in enumerate(VACUUM_SWEEP_LIST):\n        if filter_vacs is not None and vac_val not in filter_vacs:\n            continue\n        port = base_port + idx\n        run_single_condition(vac_val, vac_str, nas_folder_name, port)\n\n    log(\"🎉 All requested vacuum thickness calculations and NAS backups have completed!\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"/home/WORKSTATION4WSL/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/mdi_workspace_backup/run_2periods_vacuum_sweep_0.5_to_10A.py"}}]}
